.TH SDL_AsyncIO 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_AsyncIO \- The asynchronous I/O operation structure.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_asyncio.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef struct SDL_AsyncIO SDL_AsyncIO;
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This operates as an opaque handle\[char46] One can then request read or write operations on it\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This struct is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_AsyncIOFromFile (3)
